Build:
    navigate to parent Raytracer folder
    mkdir build
    cd build
    change in CMakeLists: cmake ..
    change in code: cmake --build . -j
Run:
    ./raytracer "local path to xml file" (obj and texture files are provided in my raytracer)

Note:
    Toggle BVH in class scene.h in with flag useBvh.
    Texutes for texture/bump mapping needs to be stored in assets/textures.

Description of the example8:
    The rendered image shows a studio-like setup with a large textured concrete sphere in the center, placed on a floor plane in front of a wall. 
    In the foreground, two smaller spheres are positioned closer to the camera, one glass sphere with refraction and partial reflection,
    one mirror sphere with full reflection.

    Effects implemented: 
        Anti-aliasing, Bump Mapping, Area Light with soft shadows, Spot Light

